4","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-liyin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017","text":"武帝踐阼，進爵為侯。雖寢疾十餘年，而時賢並相推薦。泰始中，詔曰：「光祿密陵侯袤，履行純正，守道沖粹，退有清和之風，進有素絲之節，宜登三階之曜，補袞職之闕。今以袤為司空。」天子臨軒，遣五官中郎將國坦就第拜授。袤前後辭讓，遣息稱上送印綬，至於十數。謂坦曰：「魏以徐景山為司空，吾時為侍中，受詔譬旨。徐公語吾曰：'三公當上應天心，苟非其人，實傷和氣，不敢以垂死之年，累辱朝廷也。'終於不就。遵大雅君子之跡，可不務乎！」固辭，久之見許，以侯就第，拜儀同三司，置舍人官騎，賜床帳簟褥、錢五十萬。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"國坦","kind":"person","person_id":"il3_gjq_q3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0103","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"稱","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_AD","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"坦","kind":"person","person_id":"il3_gjq_q3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"徐景山","kind":"person","person_id":"s93_91b_oxa","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line017:m0147","s